  <item>
    <title>如何看电影之《新世界》中吸烟镜头与权力更迭的关系</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63eee6de51a4e4150aa4ed9f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63eee6de51a4e4150aa4ed9f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Feb 2023 02:30:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1，石武点烟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsAu0RzL-AHyjkVZcCSo1yxHv944.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2，李子成码头叼烟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnlOtTLbtFkHZj72P9MYqW7yiEdy.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>3，李子成扔烟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fom00QKJ1NMzWvfXyYDp17QkskPd.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>4，丁青在医院里把玩从上海带回来的硬币</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVAyPXw4_Bg8irkh8gbWNjXUczS.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>5，李仲久与姜科长对话</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp6nzc7vq7NPuj7nQkL3G6Xy2Dt-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>6，姜科长出画，李子成入画</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl1OXjJ6vq2DlhplbsAieXXAs1ye.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljI40jfY5129kzNYSsEU2AQmZP73.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>7，姜科长通过蒙太奇参与局长对上级汇报新世界计划的会议</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnTCkDWo5x9KmqMCo8eFiun5wXvR.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtZbJMo69t1Bugn1-TGZ5LTG60XV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnh_tBxjnF1Zb69yQ3zSFkiiLzdL.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>8，警局会议上的丁青与李仲久</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqJJhxfGMywF3UPcZ8ya2l1ianfi.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqCFoY3io7Gzn5xOWCNT_gy_6qDi.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llkPmtTARYfOs0C6DoaQPT4zxv3C.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvLi0TJ_CftXg9m-sPLHDtr1IeN5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>9，与李子成密会时的姜科长</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuPnox9wes9udUYUTrqj-QM3dIMN.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>10，金门大会上的李仲久（第一张截图不很清楚，大屏幕上可以清晰看到烟雾）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhuhMVtIn5uMXToXy8_0cIIH7Y_H.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkChsmNgh302B-BWXUgJWgUSjX3n.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>11，李仲久离开会场后的丁青</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsWqDMgidogS2JWcug1rwRsz5Sds.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgeu__nW6r2tHpoS-cyEJSVCwsn1.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>12，与局长开会的姜科长</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3mtMFrkfGQyQdL1GJzCO5VlnKo.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq4pi0tSJ7GvThm0WcHDZDRkSoQ0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>13，在围棋教室外等候李子成的石武在跟手下嬉闹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liLSTPSexhRjZy50pk1kmH5k49ci.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsfsD_JxwI7rBL0M6E6wZHqLO1wk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>14，李仲久与理事们勾兑竞选，倒酒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkfJ--qstmQdTRYbp1HZHZwdchYZ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp59cemharo93wvL6oDStUyLIq61.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVQCA9HJw6M7j-rJXx722wLtZJA.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>15，机场里，丁青与姜科长</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhonMeExNkeQPE6_xOEnsvlL6s9r.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuQK8pD63EogzLyvBGHghRqtFCWA.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>16，丁青在餐厅得知李仲久被抓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvHsr6WZVTuJFZtH-plfUTotRawb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>17，姜科长与丁青在体育场会面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqPCproiRV1-G5AvpiZyEvRqjhID.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>18，围棋老师被抓前给姜科长打电话</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlgWbshSDbTx-RVmqM3GueoP3bJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoozGKYxyIoIHFq_-gnPW1Aj9Wyr.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>19，肃清卧底前，丁青在码头抽烟喝酒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVYQ_EpGq8EZNLQRz2PQd3NJEDx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh6IYN8f7_I8g5aBG2T1q_T0eevg.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>20，李仲久在监狱里给手下看姜科长给他的照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSk8FODbJDeFZJauzMVxD_I8a3R.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>21，在围棋教室，姜科长给李子成递烟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi6szLjOQ5dqub5Vb_Uwk5IgDC_E.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>22，新世界计划彻底摊开，姜科长与局长第一次同框，一起抽烟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbYFiBKnepPbGX_ETpqagz-JSXq.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>23，丁青在电梯大战前</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FugcaUiIuXxM5VtrEXfNIvlQhPVE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>24，局长与姜科长在酒馆，最后一场两人一起的戏</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJFsZNnlCv7IcVaftGOViXCIIf4.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuJpogKHTZ0-a699eKJDo30_mNGU.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiZQJ04_Iq7UvGtxTp5BxKXTniVA.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>25，姜科长约李子成见面，吃棒棒糖</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkmSxDYfrpPnd8DwWvVuL_NIVIMY.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiJjpw89qcM3q2LFkOZrecqACcwD.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>26，李仲久出狱回到家，发现家中有人埋伏</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqm_Z_UOEkpllRt5EY7cJsRPMIVc.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuUB4BTalkzn4fmPU53yFjN29BaZ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>27，姜科长独自垂钓，看到杀手</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsumdqy85cWd0JRO6JqxiVIgJbG0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>28，李子成宣布自己参选，坐到原来理事的位置，立刻掏出烟和打火机</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlacRUqwTjOdFBbNYgToyeDOC6oi.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>29，李子成当选金门会长后，把玩打火机</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgPJwtI2VS__fbZ58V03fyQFFSQK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>30，李子成独自一人在会长办公室烧掉自己的警察档案后，点燃“第一支”烟。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpcyGMLOhtlTYZhTgvphENxi6lM4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>31，李子成的回忆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lm181DmvZK-6NIsP2bab9YnptVc4.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhtrYvDd2rnTOMZRJfJsMJC7vlr5.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvE9Ym4-bavuCH7DeeCZenoMC-74.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnaFEuYu8IMpEgqvPkTdmkXrUo23.m4a" length="103942925" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:46:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVLeYF7CmkKsq6ekNkcvV1hjyOt.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
